---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'May 10, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service" description="Terms of Service for UFO Declassified — rules governing the use of our website.">
  <section class="container-narrow py-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h1 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Terms of Service</h1>
    </div>
    <p class="text-space-400 text-xs font-mono mb-8">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-space-200 text-sm">

      <p>
        Welcome to <strong class="text-white">UFO Declassified</strong> ("Site"), accessible at
        <a href="https://ufo-declassified.com" class="text-cyan-bright hover:underline">ufo-declassified.com</a>.
        By accessing or using this website, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms"). If you do not agree to these Terms, please do not use the Site.
      </p>

      <div class="glass-panel p-6 my-8">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By using this Site, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms and our <a href="/privacy" class="text-cyan-bright hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>. We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Continued use of the Site after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.</p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Description of Service</h2>
      <p>
        UFO Declassified is an independent, non-governmental website that organizes and presents declassified UAP (Unidentified Anomalous Phenomena) documents released by the U.S. government under the PURSUE initiative. We provide:
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li>A searchable, browsable archive of public domain government documents</li>
        <li>Contextual analysis and commentary on released materials</li>
        <li>Media coverage tracking of the PURSUE document release</li>
        <li>Educational content about UAP-related government programs</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        <strong class="text-white">Government Documents:</strong> All declassified government documents, images, and videos hosted on this site are public domain materials released by the United States government. These materials are not subject to copyright restrictions.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong class="text-white">Document Catalog (CC BY 4.0):</strong> The document catalog — the record index, metadata, and source-status labeling, published as a CSV export at <a href="/dataset/uap-documents.csv" class="text-cyan-bright hover:underline">/dataset/uap-documents.csv</a> and archived at <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21605258" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-cyan-bright hover:underline">doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21605258</a> — is released under the <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-cyan-bright hover:underline">Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license</a>. You are free to share and adapt it, including commercially, provided you give attribution. No prior permission is required.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong class="text-white">Site Content:</strong> Other original content created by UFO Declassified — including site design, written analysis, commentary, and blog articles — is the intellectual property of UFO Declassified and is protected by applicable copyright laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works from that content without prior written permission. This restriction does not apply to the CC BY 4.0 document catalog described above.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">User Conduct</h2>
      <p>You agree not to:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li>Use the Site for any unlawful purpose or in violation of any applicable laws</li>
        <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to any part of the Site, its servers, or any connected systems</li>
        <li>Use automated tools (bots, scrapers, crawlers) to access the Site in a manner that places undue burden on our infrastructure</li>
        <li>Transmit any malware, viruses, or other harmful code</li>
        <li>Misrepresent your identity or affiliation with any person or organization</li>
        <li>Interfere with or disrupt the integrity or performance of the Site</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        This Site is provided on an <strong class="text-white">"as is" and "as available"</strong> basis without warranties of any kind, either express or implied, including but not limited to implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement.
      </p>
      <p>Specifically, we do not warrant that:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li>The information on this Site is complete, accurate, or current</li>
        <li>The Site will be available at all times, uninterrupted, or error-free</li>
        <li>Any defects or errors will be corrected</li>
        <li>The Site is free of viruses or other harmful components</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, UFO Declassified and its operators shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or any loss of profits, data, or goodwill, resulting from your access to or use of (or inability to access or use) the Site, any content on the Site, or any linked third-party websites.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Accuracy of Information</h2>
      <p>
        While we strive to present government documents accurately and provide thoughtful analysis, we make no guarantees regarding the accuracy, completeness, or reliability of any content on this Site. Our analysis and commentary represent independent interpretation and should not be taken as official government positions, legal advice, or definitive conclusions about the nature of any reported phenomena.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>
        This Site contains links to third-party websites, including government portals (war.gov, archives.gov), news organizations, and social media platforms. These links are provided for convenience and informational purposes only. We do not endorse, control, or assume responsibility for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party websites.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Government Affiliation Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        UFO Declassified is <strong class="text-white">not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to</strong> any U.S. government agency, including but not limited to the Department of War, FBI, NASA, Department of State, or National Archives and Records Administration. References to these agencies are made solely in the context of documenting publicly released materials.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Termination</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to terminate or suspend your access to the Site, without prior notice or liability, for any reason whatsoever, including without limitation if you breach these Terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the United States, without regard to its conflict of law provisions.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to update or modify these Terms at any time without prior notice. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting to this page with an updated revision date. Your continued use of the Site following any changes constitutes acceptance of the new Terms.
      </p>

      <div class="glass-panel p-6 my-8">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us:</p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          <strong class="text-white">Email:</strong>
          <a href="mailto:contact@ufo-declassified.com" class="text-cyan-bright hover:underline">contact@ufo-declassified.com</a>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-1">
          <strong class="text-white">Website:</strong>
          <a href="https://ufo-declassified.com" class="text-cyan-bright hover:underline">ufo-declassified.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
